g/tax assumptions, with explicit exclusions. | Specified bounded corporate package in Chs. 2, 8 with exact annual/interim and forecast fixtures. Delivery, collection, purchase, payment, costs, plant, payroll, debt, simple tax and closing reconcile. Real tax/revenue/lease/FX packages remain separate work. G4, G5. |\n80:| MC16 | Produce coherent financial statements, movements and supported note schedules from the same underlying history/path. U1, U2, D. | Define balance sheet, income/comprehensive income, cash flow and equity mappings, non-cash movements, closing and note relationships; supply a full set of expected outputs. | Reference-checked complete Northstar balance sheet, income/zero OCI, direct/indirect cash flow and equity from common journals; Chs. 2, 8 and `northstar.json`. Apple checks a coherent marginal financing stress only. General note schedules and report engine remain pending. G4, G5, G6. |\n81:| MC17 | Represent financing instruments and their economic/accounting lifecycles, particularly bonds and equity. U1, U2, D. | Specify proceeds, principal, carrying/fair values, rates, calendars, maturities, rights and share quantities; work issuance, accrual, settlement and relevant modification/conversion/default cases under declared treatments. | Partially specified and reference-checked: Chs. 8–9 distinguish principal/carrying/fair values and work ordinary and convertible bond issue, accrual, redemption/conversion, shares and funding default. Detailed modification, early repurchase and other-basis hybrid classification remain open. G4, G7. |\n82:| MC18 | Preserve joint conditional future outcomes, honest bounds and distinct failure/completeness states. U2, P, D. | Define result payloads and queries that retain branch/path dependence, distinguish sampled ranges from certified bounds and distinguish default from unsupported/numerically failed output without silent dropping or renormalisation. | Specified result cells, branch statuses, strict bound attainment and unresolved mass in Chs. 6, 8, 10/Core 0. Exact linear, joint-output and funding/default reference checks pass; general simulation/result-query implementation remains pending. G2, G3, G6. |\n102:| MC28 | Connect the full design through complete synthetic and real disclosure cases. U1, U2, U3, D. | Supply a known-history synthetic company and a named annual/interim real package across multiple dates; trace representative notes through records, constraints, alternatives and all affected future statements. Add structural finance/sector cases before fixing the core types. | Reference cases delivered in Ch. 2: complete synthetic Northstar history/revision/forecast and named Apple annual/interim inventory, notes and conditional stress. Ch. 9 supplies sector/finance structures. Real-company full semantic closure and independent case annotation remain open; no complete Apple forecast is claimed. G4, G5, G7. Nine eight-year report sequences are now source-checked; report-wide semantic cases and executable oracles remain to be prepared. |\nscripts/apple_case_v1.py:50:class CaseError(ValueError):\nscripts/apple_case_v1.py:54:def require(condition, message):\nscripts/apple_case_v1.py:59:def sha(data):\nscripts/apple_case_v1.py:63:def file_hash(path):\nscripts/apple_case_v1.py:67:def power10(n):\nscripts/apple_case_v1.py:71:def number(literal):\nscripts/apple_case_v1.py:81:def interval(value, quantum):\nscripts/apple_case_v1.py:87:def interval_sum(observations, coefficients=None):\nscripts/apple_case_v1.py:98:def compatible(left, right):\nscripts/apple_case_v1.py:102:class Document:\nscripts/apple_case_v1.py:144:def discover_notes(doc, expected):\nscripts/apple_case_v1.py:158:def context(period, dimensions=None):\nscripts/apple_case_v1.py:163:def observation(oid, concept, value, literal, scale, quantum, ctx, measurement, anchors, **extra):\nscripts/apple_case_v1.py:171:def annual_row(doc, label, column, ctx, concept, measurement, bounds, columns,\nscripts/apple_case_v1.py:1